 a bound method of the defaultdict itself recursed"] [535 4 "// until Go's stack overflowed, test_defaultdict's test_recursive_repr)"] [560 2 "// defdict_or (Modules/_collectionsmodule.c): left | right with a defaultdict on either side is"] [561 2 "// type(dd)(dd.default_factory, left) updated with right, NotImplemented when the other is no dict (queue 287:"] [562 2 "// the dict's slot gave a plain dict, test_defaultdict's test_union)"] [585 78 "// a the right operand"] [634 34 "// py-mods-1122: the C OrderedDict (builtins_odict.go)"] [642 1 "// defaultMissing is defaultdict.__missing__: the factory's value stored under k, a KeyError without one."] [651 2 "// defdict_missing's PyDict_SetDefaultRef (3.14.10, gh-145492): a value the factory itself stored under k"] [652 2 "// stays and is the result (queue 287: test_defaultdict's test_factory_conflict_with_set_value)"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[39 45] [62 24] [96 30] [195 25] [222 13] [222 40] [270 13] [270 20] [281 42] [345 30] [349 23] [356 77] [356 88] [363 13] [363 40] [400 17] [400 47] [442 13] [442 20] [459 32] [459 39] [490 16] [523 28] [524 56] [568 28] [579 47] [587 48] [596 63] [653 30] [656 28]]} (go/file "builtins_collections.go" :imports [

